## 1) 기존 실습 컨테이너 정리
$ docker ps -a --format "table {{.Names}}	{{.Status}}"
NAMES      STATUS
web-bind   Up 27 minutes (healthy)
web-8080   Up 36 minutes (healthy)

$ docker rm -f web-8080 web-bind
web-8080
web-bind

$ docker ps -a
CONTAINER ID   IMAGE     COMMAND   CREATED   STATUS    PORTS     NAMES

