## 3) 상태 확인 (docker compose ps)
$ docker compose ps
NAME         IMAGE            COMMAND                   SERVICE   CREATED                  STATUS                                     PORTS
cody-cache   redis:7-alpine   "docker-entrypoint.s…"   cache     Less than a second ago   Up Less than a second                      6379/tcp
cody-web     cody-web:1.0     "/docker-entrypoint.…"   web       Less than a second ago   Up Less than a second (health: starting)   80/tcp, 0.0.0.0:8090->8080/tcp, [::]:8090->8080/tcp

$ docker ps --format "table {{.Names}}	{{.Status}}	{{.Ports}}"
NAMES        STATUS                                     PORTS
cody-web     Up Less than a second (health: starting)   80/tcp, 0.0.0.0:8090->8080/tcp, [::]:8090->8080/tcp
cody-cache   Up Less than a second                      6379/tcp

## 4) 호스트에서 웹 접속 + 환경변수 확인
$ curl -s http://localhost:8090/healthz
ok

$ curl -s http://localhost:8090/env
APP_ENV=compose
NGINX_PORT=8080

$ curl -s http://localhost:8090/ | grep "<h1>"
    <h1>개발 워크스테이션 구축</h1>

$ docker compose ps --format "table {{.Name}}	{{.Status}}"
NAME         STATUS
cody-cache   Up 32 seconds
cody-web     Up 31 seconds (healthy)

## 5) 컨테이너 간 통신 : web 에서 서비스 이름 'cache' 로 접근
$ docker compose exec web getent hosts cache
192.168.97.2      cache  cache

$ docker compose exec web sh -c "echo -e \"PING\" | nc cache 6379"
+PONG

$ docker compose exec cache redis-cli -h cache ping
PONG

$ docker compose exec cache redis-cli set greeting "hello-from-compose"
OK

$ docker compose exec cache redis-cli get greeting
hello-from-compose

## 6) 호스트에서는 cache 에 직접 접근할 수 없다 (포트를 열지 않았으므로)
$ curl -s --max-time 3 http://localhost:6379 ; echo "종료코드=$?"
종료코드=7

